s、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":19,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:11.950Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"e8e44c48-be14-4d89-8837-7fec869b9e27","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt_id":"e8e44c48-be14-4d89-8837-7fec869b9e27","session_id":"16334f22-b7fe-4958-96c2-a87fc110b0ad","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"52622369-5b44-4d99-aebb-7a5a16a1b914","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"a6745684-5700-44dc-8043-88bd78aabb52","thread":"52622369-5b44-4d99-aebb-7a5a16a1b914","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-a6745684-5700-44dc-8043-88bd78aabb52"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-x2ar1zbo/state/worktrees/e8e44c48-be14-4d89-8837-7fec869b9e27","base_commit":"cc78786bee3deabb5a929bcf7b75c6204c5717e9","card_snapshot_id":"be5b4b57-611a-4fc1-b6ef-c93376b7dfe2","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261011-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":20,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:13.102Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"e8e44c48-be14-4d89-8837-7fec869b9e27","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-x2ar1zbo/repo","cat-file","-t","92d13a9f480a0abbb6138fca913603b57d516c32"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-x2ar1zbo/repo"}},{"seq":21,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:13.108Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"e8e44c48-be14-4d89-8837-7fec869b9e27","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-x2ar1zbo/repo","cat-file","-t","92d13a9f480a0abbb6138fca913603b57d516c32"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-x2ar1zbo/repo","stdout":"commit\n","stderr":"","exit":0,"returncode":0}},{"seq":22,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:13.109Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"e8e44c48-be14-4d89-8837-7fec869b9e27","type":